{"id":"steam-1356950","steam":1356950,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Edentopia","summary":"An open-world sandbox ARPG where every weapon transforms how you fight. Hunt monsters, craft gear and create deep character builds through stats, enchantments, spells, equipment and pets. Explore freely, survive chaotic boss fights, and carve your path through a world of magic, danger, and discovery","about":"Features\n\n• \nHuge OpenWorld to explore\n• \nWeapons differ in attack patterns and playstyle \n• \nUnlock classes and spells from an ever-growing spell tree\n• \nFull character customizations, hair combinations, vanity slots \n• \nExplore find and fight bosses to craft the best equipment, included vanity slot to individualize your character\n• \nWeapon progression crafting tree\n• \nWeapon slot upgrade system with playstyle individualization\n\n• \nWorld is sandbox, build and settle anywhere, set up farms, structures and decorations\n• \nTransformable terrain \n• \nDestructible battlefield, you destroy environment and so does Bosses, but everything will regrow overtime\n\n• \nXBOX Controller Support: Utilize twin stick playstyle, or traditional top-down joypad style with auto-aiming support toggle. (auto-aim works with mouse and keyboard playstyle)\n• \nMusic by Dale North\n\n  \n\n\r\n\r\n\nEmbark on an epic adventure in a vast, open world  crafting game where the power of magic is yours to wield. Collect and craft new spells as you explore the world, discovering rare and valuable items to aid you in your journey. Battle unique bosses and expand your base and individualize your settlement. With endless possibilities for customization and exploration, every playthrough is a unique and thrilling experience.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356950/d14a4bb5d8083b535c6490f9b7fdaab211fe1603/library_capsule.jpg?t=1794276947","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356950/02ed01c2c791